---

Start with this page. Edit `content/index.smd` for the words,
`layouts/page.shtml` for the HTML, and `assets/style.css` for the styles.

Build with `zigapagos release`. Deploy the files in `public/` to a static host.

Add components, a CSS framework, or a design system when your project needs them.
